# Web Design System

- Current system is v2.1: teal primary `#10B89B`, slate neutrals, and Poppins for headings and body.
- Treat `apps/web/src/app/globals.css` and `layout.tsx` as authoritative.
- Use CSS variables and existing utilities such as `bg-primary`, `text-primary`, `bg-ink`, `bg-gradient-hero`, `shadow-soft`, and `shadow-glow`.
- Do not hardcode colors or introduce the obsolete coral, green, Syne, Manrope, or Plus Jakarta systems.
- Reuse existing shadcn/base-ui components, rounded/pill treatments, and layout patterns.
- Base-UI Button has no `asChild`; use its `render` prop or apply `buttonVariants` to a Link.
- Use existing Font Awesome/category icon helpers; avoid emoji as interface icons.
- Maps use MapLibre with OSM/Photon, not Mapbox.

## User identity links

- Wrap clickable avatar/name identity units with `<UserLink userId={...}>`.
- Do not include action buttons inside `UserLink`.
- Do not nest `UserLink` inside a Table-card Link; link the host on the detail page instead.
- Public profiles live at `/u/[id]` and must use public-safe data.

Prefer the current page/component patterns over outdated design PDFs or historical brand documents.

